                ],
                "InformationType": "Optional"
              },
              "Description": "The operation that provides additional constraints to the climate simulation selection like origin of source (e.g., institution, country of origin), etc. Provide information with URIs taken from the KG where possible.",
              "@type": "top:Operation",
