                  "Choose global warming level",
                  "Choose global warming level extraction method",
                  "Filter climate simulations by global warming level exceedance"
                ]
              },
              "Description": "The operation that extracts the time slice centered around the point in time when the specific global warming level is exceeded.",
              "@type": "top:Operation",
              "Label": "Extract global warming level time slice",
              "@id": "ops:ExtractGlobalWarmingLevelTimeSlice",
              "InformationRoles": [
                {
                  "@type": "top:InformationRole",
